onalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.78;exitY=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c67"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="568.2" y="217"/><mxPoint x="1086" y="217"/><mxPoint x="1086" y="492"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c69" value="&lt;b&gt;Quanto aguenta&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="780" width="1650" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c70" value="• &lt;b&gt;Reconhecimento:&lt;/b&gt; 2 × ~2,5–3,5 rostos/s = ~5–7/s → pico de ~2.000–2.800 funcionários; confortável até ~1.500–2.000. Com VMs de 2 vCPU no reconhecimento, o dobro.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Core:&lt;/b&gt; o mesmo do Tier 1. Suba para 2 vCPU · 8 GB quando passar de ~3 mil funcionários ou o portal ficar lento.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Custo:&lt;/b&gt; 3 VPS + S3 ≈ R$ 130–170/mês. Ligando a VM 3 só das 7:00 às 9:00, quase não pesa." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="808" width="1650" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c71" value="&lt;b&gt;Fluxo de uma batida&lt;/b&gt; · ① api-coletor pergunta ao face-engine “quem é?” (síncrono, ~0,3–1 s) → ② &lt;b&gt;COMMIT&lt;/b&gt; da batida na tabela &lt;b&gt;entrada&lt;/b&gt; com status &lt;i&gt;pendente&lt;/i&gt; (a partir daqui ela existe em disco) → ③ &lt;b&gt;publica&lt;/b&gt; na &lt;b&gt;fila batidas&lt;/b&gt; (fora da transação) e responde ao aparelho “Maria, recebido” + QR → ④ rep-core &lt;b&gt;consome&lt;/b&gt; → ⑤ numa transação só: NSR + hash em &lt;b&gt;registros&lt;/b&gt;, entrada = &lt;i&gt;processado&lt;/i&gt;, eventos “gerar PDF / calcular jornada / QR oficial” no &lt;b&gt;outbox&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;i&gt;pendente&lt;/i&gt;) → ⑥ &lt;b&gt;publica&lt;/b&gt; na &lt;b&gt;fila pós-batida&lt;/b&gt; → ⑦ jobs &lt;b&gt;consome&lt;/b&gt;, faz o trabalho e marca o evento como &lt;i&gt;processado&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Garantia:&lt;/b&gt; a tabela é a fonte da verdade; a fila só transporta. Quem marca &lt;i&gt;processado&lt;/i&gt; é o consumidor, ao terminar. O &lt;b&gt;resgate&lt;/b&gt; roda sempre e republica o que está &lt;i&gt;pendente&lt;/i&gt; há mais de 30 s (queda entre o COMMIT e a publicação, ou mensagem perdida no Valkey). Duplicatas são inofensivas: jobId no BullMQ + unicidade no banco (aparelho + sequência, NSR + tarefa).&lt;br&gt;Se o face-engine demorar mais de ~1,5 s, o aparelho pede PIN + foto: a batida entra na hora e o rosto é conferido depois." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="910" width="1650" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Tier 3 - escala" id="Tier3-"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="Tier 3 · 6+ VMs · ~3 mil a 20 mil+ funcionários" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=20;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1650" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="Separar o banco, duplicar o core atrás de um balanceador e ter N máquinas de reconhecimento (ou uma GPU no pico). Mesmo código: muda só onde cada processo roda." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="42" width="1650" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#232F3D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;html=1;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.mobile_client;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="230" width="41" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="Aparelhos coletores&lt;br&gt;tablet · celular · PC" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="15.5" y="312" width="170" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#232F3D;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;html=1;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.users;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="420" width="60" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="RH · trabalhador · auditor&lt;br&gt;+ página pública do QR" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="15.0" y="484" width="170" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;Cloudflare&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;DNS · proteção dos portais&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#F38020;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="410" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;Monitor externo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;avisa se a VM sumir&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="540" width="150" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;NTP Observatório Nac.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;hora oficial (chrony)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="625" width="150" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="78" width="330" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;API (HTTP)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="100" width="160" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;Worker (sem tela)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#3F8F3F;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="100" width="160" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;API interna Python&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="136" width="160" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;Tabela no Postgres&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="136" width="160" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;Fila de mensagens (BullMQ no Valkey)&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="172" width="330" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;Load balancer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;NLB ou do provedor&lt;br&gt;(camada 4, passthrough)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#009639;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="330" width="150" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="Core · 2 VMs iguais · 2 vCPU · 8 GB" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;container=0;collapsible=0;pointerEvents=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;rounded=1;arcSize=3;dashed=1;strokeColor=#D86613;fontColor=#D86613;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="110" width="420" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;VM core A&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;APIs: nginx · api-coletor · api-portal + Next.js · signer&lt;br&gt;workers: rep-core · jobs · resgate&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;os workers das duas VMs consomem as mesmas filas&lt;br&gt;(BullMQ entrega cada job a um só worker)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="150" width="380" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;VM core B&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;igual à A&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;se uma cair, o balanceador manda tudo para a outra&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="340" width="380" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="Reconhecimento · N VMs (2–4 vCPU) ou 1 GPU" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;container=0;collapsible=0;pointerEvents=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;rounded=1;arcSize=3;dashed=1;strokeColor=#2563EB;fontColor=#2563EB;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="110" width="360" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="&lt;b&gt;face-engine 1 … N&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;~1.500–2.000 funcionários por VM de 2 vCPU&lt;br&gt;extras ligam só no pico (agenda)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="150" width="320" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;b&gt;ou face-engine em GPU&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;~100–300 rostos/s → dezenas de milhares&lt;br&gt;de funcionários; ligada só no pico&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="265" width="320" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="A api-coletor só conhece a lista de engines saudáveis e reparte entre elas. Escalar = adicionar uma VM na lista." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="380" width="320" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="Banco e filas · VMs dedicadas" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;container=0;collapsible=0;pointerEvents=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;rounded=1;arcSize=3;dashed=1;strokeColor=#9673A6;fontColor=#9673A6;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="560" width="820" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;Postgres primário&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;4 vCPU · 16 GB · bancos arp e app&lt;br&gt;tabelas de outbox: entrada · outbox&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="600" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;Postgres réplica síncrona&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Patroni promove se o&lt;br&gt;primário cair (~30 s)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="600" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="&lt;b&gt;VM pequena&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Valkey + Sentinel (BullMQ)&lt;br&gt;etcd · Grafana / alertas&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2937;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1150" y="600" width="240" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="S3 (ou compatível)" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;container=0;collapsible=0;pointerEvents=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=30;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;rounded=1;arcSize=3;dashed=1;strokeColor=#3F8F3F;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#3F8F3F;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1450" y="110" width="240" height="610" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" value="" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#7AA116;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;html=1;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.s3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="160" width="56" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="comprovantes (PDF) · AFD · AEJ" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1490.0" y="220" width="160" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#7AA116;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;html=1;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.s3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="300" width="56" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="WORM (Object Lock)&lt;br&gt;selo diário das cadeias" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1490.0" y="360" width="160" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#7AA116;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;html=1;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.s3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="440" width="56" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="backups do Postgres&lt;br&gt;WAL contínuo · fotos (7 d)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1490.0" y="500" width="160" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="HTTPS + mTLS" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="c7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="HTTPS" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c7" target="c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.7;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="quem é?" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.4;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="SQL" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.3;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c19" target="c25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="WAL síncrono" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c25" target="c26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="backup" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.86;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="&lt;b&gt;Quanto aguenta&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="1650" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="• &lt;b&gt;Reconhecimento:&lt;/b&gt; cresce linear: cada VM de 2 vCPU ≈ +1.500–2.000 funcionários; uma GPU no pico substitui ~10–20 VMs de CPU.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Core:&lt;/b&gt; 2 VMs de 2 vCPU passam de 20 mil funcionários com folga; o que limita antes é o banco, que aqui tem VM própria e réplica.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Quando vir para cá:&lt;/b&gt; cliente exigindo garantia de disponibilidade, ou ~3 mil+ funcionários. Custo varia muito com o provedor: ~R$ 600–1.500/mês em VPS; mais na AWS." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="768" width="1650" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="&lt;b&gt;Fluxo de uma batida&lt;/b&gt; · ① api-coletor pergunta ao face-engine “quem é?” (síncrono, ~0,3–1 s) → ② &lt;b&gt;COMMIT&lt;/b&gt; da batida na tabela &lt;b&gt;entrada&lt;/b&gt; com status &lt;i&gt;pendente&lt;/i&gt; (a partir daqui ela existe em disco) → ③ &lt;b&gt;publica&lt;/b&gt; na &lt;b&gt;fila batidas&lt;/b&gt; (fora da transação) e responde ao aparelho “Maria, recebido” + QR → ④ rep-core &lt;b&gt;consome&lt;/b&gt; → ⑤ numa transação só: NSR + hash em &lt;b&gt;registros&lt;/b&gt;, entrada = &lt;i&gt;processado&lt;/i&gt;, eventos “gerar PDF / calcular jornada / QR oficial” no &lt;b&gt;outbox&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;i&gt;pendente&lt;/i&gt;) → ⑥ &lt;b&gt;publica&lt;/b&gt; na &lt;b&gt;fila pós-batida&lt;/b&gt; → ⑦ jobs &lt;b&gt;consome&lt;/b&gt;, faz o trabalho e marca o evento como &lt;i&gt;processado&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Garantia:&lt;/b&gt; a tabela é a fonte da verdade; a fila só transporta. Quem marca &lt;i&gt;processado&lt;/i&gt; é o consumidor, ao terminar. O &lt;b&gt;resgate&lt;/b&gt; roda sempre e republica o que está &lt;i&gt;pendente&lt;/i&gt; há mais de 30 s (queda entre o COMMIT e a publicação, ou mensagem perdida no Valkey). Duplicatas são inofensivas: jobId no BullMQ + unicidade no banco (aparelho + sequência, NSR + tarefa).&lt;br&gt;Se o face-engine demorar mais de ~1,5 s, o aparelho pede PIN + foto: a batida entra na hora e o rosto é conferido depois." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="900" width="1650" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>